<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo Corp 1996 net rises 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Corp 1996 net rises 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				    667.68 vs    584.24</p>
<p>    Net profit				    72.96 vs     60.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)	    8.0  vs	8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  19,012.32 vs 15,024.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				90.96 vs     76.82</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both profit)	   32.80 vs     24.86</p>
<p>NOTE - Daewoo Corp is a trading and construction affiliate million shares at the end of 1996, unchanged from a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
